give @s written_book[written_book_content={author:"King Abir, Ahsan, Dip, Safwan, Rohit",title:"Hajaribagh Gazette",pages:[{"text": "=== HAJARIBAGH ===\n\nJatio Sangsad of Hajaribagh\n(Kingdom of King Abir)\n\nEdition: v7.0 (2026-10-26)\nLumber, Statues & Expansion\n\nAuthors:\n* King Abir\n* Ahsan\n* Dip\n* Safwan (Goth Hunter)\n* Rohit ATB"},{"text": "=== EXECUTIVE HIERARCHY ===\n\nKing Abir alone retains supreme sovereign authority.\n\nAll ministers, first lady, and incoming citizens share equal status beneath the King.\n\n* King Abir (Kowsyke)\nPrime Minister & Supreme Ruler\n\n* Ahsane (@sanerar)\nPresident (Rashtrapati)"},{"text": "=== MINISTRIES ===\n\n* Dip (Moderator)\nMinister of Communication\n(Jogajog Montri, GitHub Ops)\n\n* Safwan (GothHunterJamal)\nMinister of Tourism, Wildlife & Hunting (Explorer)\n\n* Rohit ATB\n(GREAT-RED-DRAGO)\nMinister of Agriculture &\nTannery (Hajaribagh Local)"},{"text": "=== FALLING TREES ===\n\nRapid Lumber Harvesting:\nChop the bottom log of any tree with an axe to fell the entire trunk and clear all attached leaves instantly.\n\nBuilder Protection:\nSneak while chopping to disable the tree fall. This lets you harvest or edit individual logs safely when building houses."},{"text": "=== ARMOR POSES & ARMS ===\n\nLiving Statues:\nArmor stands have arms by default, letting them hold swords, shields, or tools.\n\nPosing Controls:\nSneak and right click any armor stand with an empty hand to cycle through 12 poses. Use them to place royal guards, sentries, and decorations around towns."},{"text": "=== SMOOTH SLEEPING ===\n\nTime Warp Sleeping:\nWhen a citizen climbs into bed, night accelerates smoothly without requiring every player to sleep.\n\nThe server displays an active sleep bar in chat as night turns to dawn."},{"text": "=== SATELLITE 3D MAP ===\n\nLive Realm Viewer:\nA live 3D Google Earth map of the entire Kingdom is hosted directly on the server.\n\nAccess:\nOpen in any browser or phone:\nhttp://132.226.135.26:8100\n\nShows live player locations, 3D builds, and terrain in real time."},{"text": "=== BEDROCK CROSS-PLAY ===\n\nUniversal Access:\nFriends on mobile (iOS and Android), Nintendo Switch, PlayStation, Xbox, and Windows Bedrock edition can now join the realm.\n\nBedrock Port: 19132\nServer IP: 132.226.135.26"},{"text": "=== GTA RAPID TRANSIT ===\n\nCinematic Sky Travel:\nFast travel across the realm with full GTA-style aerial transitions.\n\nCommands:\n* /trigger gtp\nOpens the Transit Menu with one-click destinations.\n\n* /trigger tp_base\nSky transit to Base.\n\n* /trigger tp_spawn\nSky transit to Spawn."},{"text": "=== RADAR MINIMAP ===\n\nSafe Corner Radar:\nType /trigger minimap to receive the Kingdom Radar in your inventory.\n\nYour shields and offhand items remain completely safe. Press [F] to swap the radar into your left hand whenever you wish."},{"text": "=== DRAGON SYSTEM ===\n\nRideable & Combat Dragons:\nYou can summon, tame, fly, and fight with your personal Ender Dragon.\n\nTo Summon:\n* Use the Book of Dragons in your inventory, or type:\n/trigger rd_summon\n\nMounting:\nRight click neck with empty hand."},{"text": "=== DRAGON COMBAT ===\n\nFireball Breath:\nHold an End Crystal while mounted to shoot explosive Dragon Fireballs.\n\nFlight Controls:\n* Look UP to climb\n* Look DOWN to dive\n\nStabling & Quiet:\n* /trigger rd_vanish (Store)\n* /trigger rd_silence (Mute)"},{"text": "=== MOAR BOSSES ===\n\n7 Elemental Mythic Bosses:\nWitches and Endermen manifest as world bosses with custom health bars and multi-phase magic attacks.\n\n1. Ignis (Nether)\n2. Aquos (Oceans/Rivers)\n3. Terra (Forests/Plains)\n4. Aero (Mountains Y>130)\n5. Voltos (Deserts/Badlands)\n6. Ferrum (Deep Caves Y<0)\n7. Poultry Overlord (Plains)"},{"text": "=== MORE MOBS (85+ VARIANTS) ===\n\nOver 85 specialized mob variants across all biomes:\n* Desert Mummies\n* Swamp Cultists\n* Skeleton Snipers\n* Nether Legionnaires\n* Drowned Pirates\n\nSpawn with custom gear, heads, and rare drops."},{"text": "=== CANNABIS FARMING ===\n\n1. Seeds:\nCraft 1 Wheat Seed + 1 Dried Kelp = 2 Cannabis Seeds. Or punch wild ferns.\n\n2. Plant & Grow:\nPlant on hydrated farmland. Bonemeal accelerates growth.\n\n3. Harvest & Cure:\nHarvest raw buds and dry them on a campfire, smoker, or furnace."},{"text": "=== ROLL & SMOKE ===\n\n4. Roll Joints:\nCraft 1 Cured Bud + 1 Paper = 3 Joints.\n\n5. Smoke:\nRight click or use /trigger smoke to puff animated cannabis smoke rings."},{"text": "=== SALMAN F RAHMAN ===\n\nGold Tycoon Trophy:\nThe citizen who mines the most gold ore is crowned Salman F Rahman.\n\nPerks & Rewards:\n* Pulsing rainbow glow font\n* Daily random ore at sunrise\n\nCommands:\n* /trigger taxfraud (5s view)"},{"text": "=== USEFUL COMMANDS ===\n\n* /trigger gtp (Transit Menu)\n* /trigger tp_base (Fly to Base)\n* /trigger tp_spawn (Fly to Spawn)\n* /trigger minimap (Radar Map)\n* /trigger guide (Get this book)\n* /trigger rd_summon (Dragon)\n* /trigger smoke (Smoke joint)\n* /trigger taxfraud (Tycoon board)\n* /spark health (Server TPS)"}]}],custom_name='{"text":"✦ Parliamentary Gazette ✦","color":"gold","bold":true,"italic":false}',lore=['{"text":"Edition v7.0: Expansion Edition","color":"yellow","italic":false}','{"text":"Kingdom of King Abir Official Guide","color":"gray","italic":false}']]
scoreboard players set @s guide_version 13
